1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,980
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:46,980
=Episode 15=

4
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,300
Su Cao.

5
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:09,860
You wretch!

6
00:01:19,460 --> 00:01:20,290
Help!

7
00:01:27,290 --> 00:01:28,180
Someone, help!

8
00:01:32,690 --> 00:01:33,660
(Once this palace job is done)

9
00:01:34,050 --> 00:01:35,130
(and I get paid,)

10
00:01:35,690 --> 00:01:37,330
(I'll buy you a fur collar.)

11
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:38,130
(If others can have one,)

12
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:39,570
(so can you.)

13
00:01:39,930 --> 00:01:41,490
How dare a lowly grass weaver

14
00:01:41,820 --> 00:01:43,210
talk back to Her Highness?

15
00:01:43,570 --> 00:01:44,620
What are you waiting for?

16
00:01:45,210 --> 00:01:46,570
Please show mercy, Your Highness!

17
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,520
(Let it go.)

18
00:02:42,730 --> 00:02:44,610
I pay my respects, Your Highness.

19
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,500
You recognize me?

20
00:02:49,890 --> 00:02:51,450
His Majesty once mentioned

21
00:02:51,730 --> 00:02:53,220
your retreat at West Buddhist Hall

22
00:02:53,570 --> 00:02:54,380
and that you prefer not to be disturbed.

23
00:02:56,100 --> 00:02:57,290
So you're Noble Lady Hui,

24
00:02:57,570 --> 00:02:59,780
His Majesty's new consort.

25
00:03:00,850 --> 00:03:01,820
Yes.

26
00:03:02,940 --> 00:03:04,060
At this hour,

27
00:03:04,450 --> 00:03:05,980
you're not at Jiyun Pavilion,

28
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:08,380
but here in a forbidden area.

29
00:03:11,890 --> 00:03:13,589
I meant to

30
00:03:13,631 --> 00:03:15,010
go see Concubine Yu,

31
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:17,290
but I'm new to the palace
and don't know my way around.

32
00:03:17,540 --> 00:03:18,690
I must have taken a wrong turn.

33
00:03:26,170 --> 00:03:27,380
You smell of sulfur

34
00:03:28,170 --> 00:03:30,130
from Mufang Pool.

35
00:03:33,690 --> 00:03:35,010
And your sleeve is wet.

36
00:03:39,730 --> 00:03:41,170
You're very observant, Your Highness.

37
00:03:41,610 --> 00:03:42,980
I was in a hurry just now.

38
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:44,540
There was water on the stone steps,

39
00:03:44,890 --> 00:03:46,570
and I accidentally got my sleeve wet.

40
00:03:47,220 --> 00:03:48,690
As for the sulfur smell,

41
00:03:49,570 --> 00:03:51,010
can't Your Highness

42
00:03:51,410 --> 00:03:52,570
smell it here too?

43
00:03:53,890 --> 00:03:56,290
I've been on retreat here for two weeks.

44
00:03:57,170 --> 00:03:59,500
It's never been this strong.

45
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:02,820
If you suspect I trespassed here,

46
00:04:03,130 --> 00:04:04,220
you can have it investigated.

47
00:04:04,890 --> 00:04:05,690
However,

48
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:08,380
Mufang Pool was the late Empress's.

49
00:04:09,130 --> 00:04:10,540
If my wrong turn

50
00:04:11,340 --> 00:04:12,780
brings the guards here to search,

51
00:04:13,290 --> 00:04:14,410
and word reaches His Majesty,

52
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:17,410
it may reopen old wounds.

53
00:04:20,410 --> 00:04:21,500
You seem

54
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:23,490
to understand the Emperor quite well.

55
00:04:24,250 --> 00:04:25,540
I wouldn't claim that.

56
00:04:26,460 --> 00:04:27,810
His Majesty's devotion

57
00:04:28,020 --> 00:04:28,900
is known throughout the palace.

58
00:04:29,490 --> 00:04:31,250
Since he has shown me such favor,

59
00:04:31,850 --> 00:04:34,250
naturally, I should think of him more.

60
00:04:37,610 --> 00:04:39,020
Are you thinking of His Majesty,

61
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:41,370
or of yourself?

62
00:04:44,490 --> 00:04:45,660
In the palace,

63
00:04:46,250 --> 00:04:47,660
if you don't think of yourself,

64
00:04:48,140 --> 00:04:49,170
you won't last long.

65
00:04:50,490 --> 00:04:52,340
I just want to live a little longer.

66
00:04:53,370 --> 00:04:55,460
But from the look in your eyes just now,

67
00:04:55,930 --> 00:04:57,460
you didn't seem afraid to die.

68
00:05:02,020 --> 00:05:03,140
It seemed more like

69
00:05:03,730 --> 00:05:05,610
you were afraid I'd ruin your plans.

70
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:16,930
If Your Highness truly wanted me dead,

71
00:05:17,490 --> 00:05:18,610
your first words

72
00:05:19,020 --> 00:05:20,050
would've been to summon the guards,

73
00:05:20,490 --> 00:05:22,980
not to ask why I was here.

74
00:05:26,370 --> 00:05:27,580
You're testing me.

75
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:28,730
I wouldn't dare.

76
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:31,340
I just don't think

77
00:05:31,730 --> 00:05:33,810
you're heartless.

78
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:37,170
You've only met me once.

79
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:38,580
How could you know

80
00:05:38,930 --> 00:05:40,540
I'm not heartless?

81
00:05:41,290 --> 00:05:42,660
You may seem withdrawn from the world,

82
00:05:43,100 --> 00:05:45,460
but you see more clearly than anyone.

83
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:47,810
Perhaps too clearly.

84
00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:49,700
That's why you can't bear to act.

85
00:05:50,340 --> 00:05:51,980
Others may call that weakness.

86
00:05:52,410 --> 00:05:53,410
But I think

87
00:05:54,340 --> 00:05:55,490
it's compassion.

88
00:05:59,290 --> 00:06:00,140
Noble Lady Hui.

89
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:03,540
His Majesty says
you resemble the late Empress.

90
00:06:04,050 --> 00:06:05,340
Seeing you now,

91
00:06:06,490 --> 00:06:08,020
perhaps he wasn't entirely wrong.

92
00:06:09,850 --> 00:06:11,469
I wouldn't dare compare myself to her.

93
00:06:11,511 --> 00:06:12,700
Of course you could never match her.

94
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:16,050
Roujia...

95
00:06:16,730 --> 00:06:18,020
never lied.

96
00:06:25,810 --> 00:06:26,810
Search carefully.

97
00:06:28,100 --> 00:06:28,850
Someone's there.

98
00:06:33,980 --> 00:06:35,100
Greetings, Your Highness.

99
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:37,580
We're conducting a routine patrol
of the restricted Mufang Pool area.

100
00:06:37,850 --> 00:06:39,079
May I ask if you've seen

101
00:06:39,121 --> 00:06:40,410
anyone suspicious?

102
00:06:44,610 --> 00:06:47,020
I've been on retreat here quite a while.

103
00:06:47,730 --> 00:06:50,410
I haven't seen anyone suspicious.

104
00:06:50,850 --> 00:06:51,580
In that case,

105
00:06:51,850 --> 00:06:52,580
I'll take my leave.

106
00:07:00,580 --> 00:07:01,490
Thank you, Your Highness.

107
00:07:02,170 --> 00:07:03,250
Why did you

108
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:05,140
really come to the palace?

109
00:07:09,250 --> 00:07:10,100
(Noble Lady Hui.)

110
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:30,290
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

111
00:07:31,660 --> 00:07:34,490
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

112
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:37,730
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

113
00:07:38,050 --> 00:07:39,800
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

114
00:07:40,260 --> 00:07:43,700
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

115
00:07:44,530 --> 00:07:47,690
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

116
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:52,050
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

117
00:07:52,970 --> 00:07:55,300
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

118
00:07:55,350 --> 00:07:57,480
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

119
00:07:57,660 --> 00:08:00,730
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

120
00:08:01,730 --> 00:08:04,880
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

121
00:08:06,470 --> 00:08:09,930
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

122
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:12,760
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

123
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:17,110
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

124
00:08:18,570 --> 00:08:21,700
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

125
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:26,930
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

126
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:35,000
♪The past has faded away♪

127
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:39,040
♪The past has faded away♪
